{"text":"So hopefully onward to a bit more positive poetry because I think it's really funny whenever I get on stage a lot of times people look at me and I think they especially when I was beginning they really expected my poem to be very angry and you know I think we all should be angry and we have a right to be so like thank you for recognizing the rage of a black woman thank you but at the same time I'm incredibly hopeful and I think that comes from where's my mother there she is my mother she's so young I was like is that my sister anyways so this is a poem that I actually was lucky enough to perform a few days ago on the 4th of July in Boston and it was for convening celebrating as you know Independence Day and that was such a hard poem to write oh my gosh","words":[{"text":"So","start":7.4,"end":7.92},{"text":"hopefully","start":7.92,"end":8.44},{"text":"onward","start":8.44,"end":8.84},{"text":"to","start":8.84,"end":9.34},{"text":"a","start":9.34,"end":9.42},{"text":"bit","start":9.42,"end":9.52},{"text":"more","start":9.52,"end":9.68},{"text":"positive","start":9.68,"end":10.08},{"text":"poetry","start":10.08,"end":10.66},{"text":"because","start":10.66,"end":13.2},{"text":"I","start":13.2,"end":13.48},{"text":"think","start":13.48,"end":13.64},{"text":"it's","start":13.64,"end":13.8},{"text":"really","start":13.8,"end":13.98},{"text":"funny","start":13.98,"end":14.42},{"text":"whenever","start":14.42,"end":14.72},{"text":"I","start":14.72,"end":14.92},{"text":"get","start":14.92,"end":15.02},{"text":"on","start":15.02,"end":15.14},{"text":"stage","start":15.14,"end":15.54},{"text":"a","start":15.54,"end":15.78},{"text":"lot","start":15.78,"end":15.9},{"text":"of","start":15.9,"end":16.0},{"text":"times","start":16.0,"end":16.14},{"text":"people","start":16.14,"end":16.48},{"text":"look","start":16.48,"end":17.06},{"text":"at","start":17.06,"end":17.26},{"text":"me","start":17.26,"end":17.68},{"text":"and","start":17.68,"end":18.84},{"text":"I","start":18.8